====== Freescale P1020EWLAN ======

Freescale developer board.
See: http://www.freescale.com/webapp/sps/site/prod_summary.jsp?code=RD_P1020WLANS

===== Hardware =====

  * Bootloader: uBoot 2009.11
  * CPU: DualCore PowerPC, P1020E, Version: 1.1, (0x80ec0011)
  * Core:  E500, Version: 5.1, (0x80212051)
  * CPU Speed: CPU0:800  MHz, CPU1:800  MHz
  * Flash size: 64 MB
  * DDR RAM:    1 GB
  * Wireless: 2x AR9380 3×3 MIMO, 802.11a/b/g/n (2.4 and 5 GHz)
  * Ethernet: 2 Gbit Ports, WAN & LAN
  * Power: 802.3af and DC
  * Serial: external
  * JTAG: yes, internal
  * 2x USB 2.0
  * 2x miniPCI-e (3T3R ready)
  * 6x Antennas
  * Board schematics

===== Software =====

Developer environment based on ltib. It runs an modified Openwrt with linux kernel 2.6.32 and a lot of patches.
Ready to go software preinstalled.


